  "description": "基于AScript扩展的python3脚本语言；\n快速开始：\n// 注册Python3脚本语言\nScript.Langs.Set(\"python3\", Python3Lang.Instance);\nstring s = @\"\n@lang python3\ndef sum(a, b) :\n\treturn a+b;\nn=10\nsum(n,5)\n\";\nvar script = new Script();\n// 上下文中指定语言，或者脚本中使用@lang指定语言\n//script.Context.Langs = new [] { \"python3\" };\nvar result = script.Eval(s);\nAssert.AreEqual(15L, result);",
